        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-93237-93833"><seg source="#source-93237-93249">それで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93249-93267"><rb>私</rb><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93267-93285">は、これから</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93285-93300"><rb>皆</rb><rt>みな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93300-93309">さんに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93309-93357"><rb>考古博物館</rb><rt>こうこはくぶつかん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93357-93360">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93360-93384"><rb>書物</rb><rt>しよもつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93384-93387">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93387-93402"><rb>上</rb><rt>うへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93402-93426">でつくり、そこへ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93426-93450"><rb>案内</rb><rt>あんない</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93450-93456">して</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93456-93480"><rb>説明</rb><rt>せつめい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93480-93486">して</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93486-93498"><rb>行</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93498-93507">かうと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93507-93522"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93522-93555">ふのでありますが、たゞ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93555-93570"><rb>今</rb><rt>いま</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93570-93582"><rb>述</rb><rt>の</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93582-93588">べた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93588-93615"><rb>順序</rb><rt>じゆんじよ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93615-93618">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93618-93633"><rb>進</rb><rt>すゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93633-93639">んで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93639-93651"><rb>行</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93651-93687