>方</rb><rt>ほう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-236661-236664">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-236664-236688"><rb>大切</rb><rt>たいせつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-236688-236706">がられたかも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-236706-236718"><rb>知</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-236718-236736">れません。（</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-236736-236781"><rb>第四十二圖</rb><rt>だいしじゆうにず</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-236781-236786">）</seg></p>
