-237596">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-237596-237611"><rb>作</rb><rt>つく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-237611-237614">り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-237614-237629"><rb>方</rb><rt>かた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-237629-237638">やその</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-237638-237656"><rb>形</rb><rt>かたち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-237656-237662">もお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-237662-237680"><rb>互</rb><rt>たがひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-237680-237683">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-237683-237695"><rb>似</rb><rt>に</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-237695-237719">てゐて、ほとんど</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-237719-237752"><rb>世界中</rb><rt>せかいじゆう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-237752-237761">、その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-237761-237776"><rb>變</rb><rt>かは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-237776-237782">りは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-237782-237800"><rb>少</rb><rt>すくな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-237800-237830">いのでありますから、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-237830-237851"><rb>文化</rb><rt>ぶんか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-237851-237854">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-237854-237878"><rb>關係</rb><rt>かんけい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-237878-237884">その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-237884-237896"><rb>他</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-237896-237899">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-237899-237926"><rb>研究</rb><rt>けんきゆう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-237926-237932">には</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-237932-237950"><rb>土器</rb><rt>どき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-237950-237959">ほどに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-237959-237980"><rb>役立</rb><rt>やくだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-237980-238007">ちません。ですから</seg><ruby type="f