        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-280682-286003"><seg source="#source-280682-280691">さて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-280691-280724"><rb>日本人</rb><rt>につぽんじん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-280724-280727">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-280727-280742"><rb>古</rb><rt>ふる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-280742-280745">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-280745-280760"><rb>墓</rb><rt>はか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-280760-280763">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-280763-280787"><rb>今日</rb><rt>こんにち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-280787-280799">のように</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-280799-280820"><rb>石碑</rb><rt>せきひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-280820-280823">や</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-280823-280847"><rb>石塔</rb><rt>せきとう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-280847-280850">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-280850-280862"><rb>立</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-280862-280898">てたのではなく、たいてい</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-280898-280934"><rb>土饅頭</rb><rt>つちまんじゆう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-280934-280946">のように</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-280946-280961"><rb>高</rb><rt>たか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-280961-280988">くなつてゐるので、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-280988-281015"><rb>私共</rb><rt>わたしども</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-281015-281027">はこれを</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-281027-281051"><rb>高塚</rb><rt>たかつか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-281051-281060">とか、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-281060-281081"><rb>古墳</rb><rt>こふん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-281081-281084">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-281084-281099"><rb>申</rb><rt>まを</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-281099-281132">してをります。そのうち</seg><ruby type=