        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-312681-316109"><seg source="#source-312681-312693">いまお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-312693-312711"><rb>話</rb><rt>はなし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-312711-312726">したような</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-312726-312750"><rb>石棺</rb><rt>せきかん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-312750-312753">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-312753-312768"><rb>塚</rb><rt>つか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-312768-312771">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-312771-312786"><rb>藏</rb><rt>をさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-312786-312816">めるときには、ぢかに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-312816-312831"><rb>土</rb><rt>つち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-312831-312834">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-312834-312849"><rb>中</rb><rt>なか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-312849-312852">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-312852-312867"><rb>埋</rb><rt>うづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-312867-312915">めたものもありますが、たいていは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-312915-312939"><rb>石棺</rb><rt>せきかん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-312939-312942">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-312942-312957"><rb>周</rb><rt>まは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-312957-312963">りに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-312963-312978"><rb>當</rb><rt>あた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-312978-312981">る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-312981-313002"><rb>場所</rb><rt>ばしよ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-313002-313014">に、まづ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-313014-313038"><rb>石圍</rb><rt>いしかこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-313038-313059">ひをして、その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-313059-313074"><rb>中</rb><rt>なか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-313074-313077">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="r