by><seg source="#source-322932-322941">にごく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-322941-322956"><rb>古</rb><rt>ふる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-322956-322959">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-322959-322980"><rb>時代</rb><rt>じだい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-322980-322983">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-322983-323016"><rb>天皇樣</rb><rt>てんのうさま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-323016-323019">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-323019-323043"><rb>御陵</rb><rt>ごりよう</rt></ruby>、すなはち『みさゝぎ』について、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-323091-323106"><rb>少</rb><rt>すこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-323106-323109">し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-323109-323124"><rb>申</rb><rt>まを</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-323124-323127">し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-323127-323139"><rb>上</rb><rt>あ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-323139-323151">げたいと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-323151-323166"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-323166-323180">ひます。</seg></p>
