        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-355302-357803"><seg source="#source-355302-355311">さて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-355311-355332"><rb>古墳</rb><rt>こふん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-355332-355335">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-355335-355350"><rb>中</rb><rt>なか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-355350-355356">から</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-355356-355368"><rb>出</rb><rt>で</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-355368-355371">る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-355371-355389"><rb>鏡</rb><rt>かゞみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-355389-355407">は、ちょうど</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-355407-355422"><rb>漢</rb><rt>かん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-355422-355428">から</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-355428-355470"><rb>六朝時代</rb><rt>りくちようじだい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-355470-355473">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-355473-355491"><rb>鏡</rb><rt>かゞみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-355491-355518">でありまして、その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-355518-355539"><rb>裏面</rb><rt>りめん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-355539-355542">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-355542-355557"><rb>顏</rb><rt>かほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-355557-355560">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-355560-355575"><rb>寫</rb><rt>うつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-355575-355578">す</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-355578-355593"><rb>面</rb><rt>めん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-355593-355596">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-355596-355629"><rb>反對面</rb><rt>はんたいめん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-355629-355650">には、たいてい</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-355650-355665"><rb>圓</rb><rt>まる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-355665-355668">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" sour