        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-412525-415389"><seg source="#source-412525-412534">その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-412534-412546"><rb>後</rb><rt>ご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-412546-412549">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-412549-412588"><rb>南朝鮮</rb><rt>みなみちようせん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-412588-412594">には</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-412594-412618"><rb>三韓</rb><rt>さんかん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-412618-412627">といふ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-412627-412642"><rb>小</rb><rt>ちひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-412642-412648">さい</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-412648-412663"><rb>國</rb><rt>くに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-412663-412666">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-412666-412690"><rb>分立</rb><rt>ぶんりつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-412690-412711">しまして、その</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-412711-412726"><rb>内</rb><rt>うち</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-412726-412750"><rb>辰韓</rb><rt>しんかん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-412750-412768">といふのが、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-412768-412789"><rb>新羅</rb><rt>しらぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-412789-412792">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-412792-412807"><rb>國</rb><rt>くに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-412807-412819">になり、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-412819-412843"><rb>弁韓</rb><rt>べんかん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-412843-412846">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-412846-412870"><rb>日本</rb><rt>につぽん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-412870-412873">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-412873-412906"><rb>植民地</rb><rt>しよくみんち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-412906-412909">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-412909-412930"><rb>任那</r